#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:1
#: 1c61b119794f4ebab3b5a3a552e5dc70
msgid "快速找出短键和净力异常结构"
msgstr "Quickly Find Short Bonds and Net-Force Outliers"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:3
#: 47ef89b178c84055a43e568d1a4023ba
msgid "训练前先做一次结构体检，通常能提前发现原子重叠、周期边界错误或未收敛的力。这里用两个互补入口建立“待复核列表”，程序不会自动删除任何结构。"
msgstr ""
"A quick structural check before training can expose overlapping atoms, "
"periodic-boundary mistakes, and unconverged forces. The two complementary "
"checks below build a review list; neither check removes structures "
"automatically."

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:5
#: 22a8bb65cac340718fad22cbfccd357d
msgid "运行两项检查"
msgstr "Run Both Checks"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:7
#: e943b53fbe3a451b93475498571f4a7f
msgid "在工具栏中依次使用 `Find non-physical structures` 和 `Check net force`："
msgstr "Use `Find non-physical structures` and then `Check net force` on the toolbar:"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:9
#: 7e4a4855d630452c99fed3a05fdcc0af
msgid "非物理距离和净力检查入口"
msgstr "Entry points for nonphysical-distance and net-force checks"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:9
#: 7e4a4855d630452c99fed3a05fdcc0af
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_checks.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_checks.png"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:14
#: b9a2129c750c450fbf228d579e251932
msgid ""
"短键检查使用 `Settings` 中的半径系数。默认 `0.7` 表示：两原子距离小于其共价半径之和的 `0.7` "
"倍时，结构会被选中。它适合发现明显碰撞，不是材料通用的成键判据。"
msgstr ""
"The short-distance check uses the radius coefficient in `Settings`. With the"
" default value `0.7`, a structure is selected when an interatomic distance "
"is below `0.7` times the sum of the two covalent radii. This is useful for "
"obvious collisions, not as a universal bonding criterion."

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:16
#: 550f021b33424100b7fde62d847ecab8
msgid "净力检查在弹窗中填写阈值，单位是 `eV/Å`："
msgstr "Enter the net-force threshold in the dialog, in `eV/Å`:"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:18
#: e92c4404817942cc992b55d7558760d4
msgid "净力阈值设置窗口"
msgstr "Net-force threshold dialog"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:18
#: e92c4404817942cc992b55d7558760d4
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_force_dialog.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_force_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:23
#: f67cc9a4609b43258013eb385dce6067
#, python-brace-format
msgid "程序计算每个结构的 $|\\sum_i \\mathbf{F}_i|$。本例用 `0.1 eV/Å` 做演示；真实阈值应结合计算精度和体系大小决定。"
msgstr ""
"The program evaluates $|\\sum_i \\mathbf{F}_i|$ for each structure. This "
"example uses `0.1 eV/Å`; choose a production threshold based on the "
"calculation accuracy and system size."

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:25
#: c10c6f7c324140e7b828db6a02d84389
msgid "把选中结果当作复核清单"
msgstr "Treat the Selection as a Review List"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:27
#: 9e0aef9d1f1d449ba323cd58650a7852
msgid "两项检查选出的可疑结构"
msgstr "Suspicious structures selected by both checks"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:27
#: 9e0aef9d1f1d449ba323cd58650a7852
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:32
#: e9fd8dd55b91431d87a82bbf8417f6f5
msgid ""
"演示数据中人为加入了一个原子重叠和一个净力异常，真实检查后共选中 2 个结构。请逐个查看几何、周期边界和对应 DFT "
"输出，确认是计算失败还是合理的高能构型。建议先导出选中结构留档，再删除确认无效的数据；如果误删，可以立即使用撤销删除。"
msgstr ""
"The demo data contain one deliberately introduced atomic overlap and one "
"net-force outlier; the real checks select two structures in total. Inspect "
"their geometry, periodic boundaries, and original DFT output to distinguish "
"calculation failures from legitimate high-energy configurations. Export the "
"selection for reference before removing confirmed invalid data. If you "
"remove the wrong structure, use undo immediately."
